ng files:**\n\nDecomposition summary body sections: Epic List, Dependency DAG (mermaid), DAG Justification, HLR Traceability Matrix, Health Warnings, Tiered Delivery (n/a — I'll state not applicable; or omit? \"if applicable\". I'll include a brief \"not applicable\" note or omit. The validator may check sections? Let me check validate_decomposition.py to be safe.)\n\nLet me check the validator script and frontmatter schema to get required fields right.\n\nAlso epic files need: Title (one line), Description, Scope, Acceptance Criteria, HLR Traceability sections. No cross-references to sibling epic IDs in body. Careful: don't mention \"E001\" etc. in bodies. In the summary, IDs are fine.\n\nLet me look at the validator and schema.","signature":"7c8503a0caf54f659846dd8cd5840663"}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20648,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8b4930f6a7c0a3f","agent_id":"a9b86ea10016ead6a","session_id":"514c5544-223d-42a7-ba52-fa0d432c2321","uuid":"321c224c-488d-465b-b9e7-66e25a26436c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:46:13.213Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Retry decompose RHAISTRAT-9014"}
