work should be routed back to the strategy, not absorbed into E002.\n75\t\n76\t## Tiered Delivery\n77\t\n78\tNot applicable. There is no external dependency with uncertain timing; the gating unknown (the GA scope) is internal to the strategy and resolved by E001. E004 and E005 deliver independent partial value in parallel while the assessment runs, which is the natural sequencing already expressed by the DAG rather than a formal tier split.\n79\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9173457229f239ec","agent_id":"ae4b94e893fe1c855","session_id":"514c5544-223d-42a7-ba52-fa0d432c2321","uuid":"af0c456a-3549-40c4-8b16-730f7fe9cbc2","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:53:20.786Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f0c288ad28397f7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
